	<regions>
		<region region-id="1" left="342" top="14.25" width="63" height="36" align-x="369" align-y="24" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Половникова Ксения 124 гр</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Вариант 7-7</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="2" left="24" top="26.25" width="287.25" height="24" align-x="40.5" align-y="36" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Задание 2.1 Рассчет равновесного состава единичной реакции</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<sp/>
				</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="3" left="36" top="74.25" width="118.5" height="12" align-x="36" align-y="84" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">C3H8 + 3H2O= 3CO + 7H2</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="4" left="54" top="98.25" width="88.5" height="96" align-x="54" align-y="108" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Исходные данные: </p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit"/>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">ZN(C3H8) = 0,14</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">ZN(H2O) = 0,85</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">ZN(CO) = 0 </p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">ZN(H2) = 0,01</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">VNS = 22500</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">ZDT = 70</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="5" left="12" top="200.25" width="393" height="168" align-x="12" align-y="210" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">1. Диапазон изменения температуры 300-700 °С </p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">2. Диапазон изменения давления 1-10 (атм)</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">3. ZDT = 70</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">4. Kp = 10^-(9988/T + 13.64)</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">5. Расход смеси 22500 м3/ч </p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">6. Доля компенсации теплового эффекта 75%</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">7. Потери в окружающую среду 6% от величины теплового потока на входе в реактор</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">8. Принять температуру на выходе из реактора отличающейся от равновесной на 17 С</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">9. Термодинамические характеристики веществ:</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Энтальпия образования веществ при 298К, кДж/моль</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">ΔΗ(C3H8) = -103,85; ΔΗ(H2O</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">) = -241,83; ΔΗ(CO)= -110,53; ΔΗ(H2) = 0,00;</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Молярная изобарная теплоёмкость, Дж/(моль*К)</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Ср(С3Н8) = 73,60; Ср(H2O) = 33,60; Ср(CO) = 29,14; Ср(Н2) = 28,84;</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="6" left="180" top="368.25" width="43.5" height="12" align-x="198" align-y="378" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Решение </p>
			</text>
		</region>
